                                                "sense_id": "2c783d5f-faae-39f5-a786-4540191b837f",
                                                "text": "2000, BIND 9 Administrator Reference Manual (9.3.2), Internet Software Consortium https://web.archive.org/web/20060619063455/http://www.bind9.net/manual/bind/9.3.2/Bv9ARM.ch01.html\nEvery name in the DNS tree is a domain, even if it is terminal, that is, has no subdomains."
                                            }
